      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We all have them. Some are stronger than others, and the weaker ones can be "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cracked",
            "zh": "破译"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in a second. Any guesses?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "They’re "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "passwords",
            "ref": "v-password"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In fact, many people are still using simple passwords that are easy to guess. “123456” is the most popular in the world. “123456789” and “12345” are the second and third. “111111” and “123123” are in the top 10 list too."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A large number of people love using their own name as a password. Women use more loving words, like “"
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sunshine",
            "ref": "v-sunshine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "” or “iloveyou”. But men like to use the names of sports more often."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In Britain, most people use “123456”. In Spain, the top password is simpler, which is “12345”. In India and Japan, it is just the word “password”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If you want to protect your data online, you need a strong password. You "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "had better",
            "ref": "v-had-better"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " use difficult words, often change your passwords and never "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "reuse",
            "zh": "重复使用"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
